    "version": "fr09-sequence-v1"
  },
  "subtitle": "Main flow: submit checkout → validate → create order and deduct stock atomically → confirm.",
  "notes": [
    "Precondition: signed-in customer, valid form and one Store. JWT/DTO checks and rate limiting run before createOrder. Browser = GuestCheckoutModal + api client.",
    "Insufficient stock or any coupon/order transaction error rolls back all stock and order writes. Matching idempotency replay returns the existing order; a changed payload returns 409.",
    "Shipping, attribution and post-commit email are summarized. Payment QR/link, wallet debit and multi-Store details are described separately. Order confirmation does not imply payment is complete."
  ],
